<title>USA: Valspar to buy automotive refinish maker.</title>
<headline>Valspar to buy automotive refinish maker.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Valspar Corp, a coatings manufacturer, said Friday it agreed to acquire House of Kolor Inc, an automotive refinish manufacturer based in Minneapolis.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The business has annual sales of about $3 million.</p>
<p>Valspar president Richard Rompala said in a statement the acquisition will complement the company's existing refinish business and add a new distribution channel as well as new products.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
